$ soundconnect configure -h
exit: 0
--- stdout
Usage of soundconnect configure:
      --auth-type string        aTrust authentication type
      --backend string          protocol backend (easyconnect or atrust)
      --login-domain string     aTrust login domain
      --server string           campus VPN gateway host or host:port
      --socks-listen string     numeric loopback SOCKS5 listener
      --upstream-proxy string   optional socks5 upstream URL
      --username string         campus account (preserves the saved account when omitted)
--- stderr
